{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/sync_acceptance.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:50:28.285172Z","id":"f891bf56a54e24f82ec9ffa76a24adc6e3b4425b25aa794f451c05ebbeccfc46","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:6bac96d","summary":"both acceptance tests are #[ignore] with a reason; Server::from_env panics naming the variables; just acceptance runs them with --ignored. cargo test reports them ignored; just acceptance passed both legs against pathbase 3d48801","supersedes":"70fa1acb78ce8e65158ab96a9732d2641d61868d512390b2ce881fc28a5d639e","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/sync_acceptance.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:50:28.327348Z","id":"3f3fdf9d070229d4b90f7947527b52efe54decc57e0845bb0cc438fdf63f5d63","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:6bac96d","summary":"doc comment states the current expectation (Codex derive prefix-stable, asserted), the assertion message is neutral; the Codex leg passed against the live server","supersedes":"76b1c3a48bded7a39f58ec67e79102bde32ec12b22b96e37328a20b0c257dfc2","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
